      "cooked": "<p>Here's the situation:&nbsp;</p><p>Fixed Point was in play,</p><p>A Villain card - Captain's Orders - reduced Turret Bot to 0HP,</p><p>Turret Bot remained in play and dealt its damage on Unity's turn,</p><p>at the Start of the Environment turn, Fixed Point was destroyed, and then so was Turret Bot,</p><p>my question is: Does this still count as Turret Bot being destroyed by a Villain Card? Should Turret Bot have been placed under La Capitan's card as per the game play rules on that card?</p>",
